        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mlungu kutanya Israeli kwa wundu ghotasa milimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghamba, “Kabenyi tarumbeta! Wamaiza waawuyangia isangenyi japo sa indu! Wandu wapo wajichikanyire ilaghano nibonyere nawo, na kughilegha mafundisho ghapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata ngera waniwanga ini Mlungu wawo, na kughamba wei awo ni wandu wapo winiichi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wamerie kulegha mecha. Niko wawuyawingwa ni wamaiza wawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wandu wapo weekusaghuya wazuri wawo weni; wawikie wabaa nisewirumirie. Wakutoteshere weni kwa kuwusa feza na dhahabu rawo wikabonya milimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naawuyazamilwa ni mlimu ghwa ngache ya dhahabu ghutaswagha ni wandu wa muzi ghwa Samaria, neeka na machu mabaa aighu yawo; ichadwa ngelo ing'ane wada ima witane nayo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni wufundi ghwa Muisraeli umu ubonyere ugho mlimu ghuseko mlungu putu. Njau ya dhahabu yawuyataswa Samaria ichabarwa-barwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wikawa mbeo, wichakuwida kiremba; mbuwa isewurushagha viro ndeinekagha vindo na hata vikava, vichajighwa ni waghenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israeli oofwanana na wandu wa iro mbari; ooka aghadi kwawo sa nyungu ibarikie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wa Israeli waghendie cha Ashuru, sa punda wa isakenyi umaraa-mara uekeri, wakuwikie wandu wa mbari zima welipwa wipate kuwilindia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela idana nichawikwanya chiaimweri nipate kuwikaba. Wichawoka kudaruma kwa kukorongwa ni mzuri wa Ashuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hata ngera Israeli waaghie madhabahu nyingi refunyira vizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a, ela sena iro madhabahu rawurie malalo ghebonyera kaung'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawiandikie mafundisho ghisetalikagha; ela waawuyaghitala sa kilambo cha kighenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadaboilwa ni kufunya vizongona kwapo, na kuja nyama raro; ela ini BWANA siboilwagha navo anduangi. Nichakumbuka kaung'a yawo na kuwikaba, nichawiwunja Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wandu wa Israeli waaghie ngome, ela wamliwie Muumbi wawo. Wandu wa Juda waaghie mizi ya ngome, ela nichaduma modo aighu ya iyo mizi ghukore ngome na mizi yawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
